localis data notice

The files in this directory are data derived from the sources below. Each
source's data remains under that source's license; localis's MIT license
covers its code only. The full license texts ship in the package metadata
(the wheel's .dist-info/licenses/ directory) and in the LICENSES/ directory
of the source repository: https://github.com/dstoffels/localis

These files are modified from their sources. localis's ingest pipeline
filters, merges and re-encodes the source data into them, and rebuilds
them monthly. The pipeline is published in the source repository under
ingest/, and docs/methodology.md there describes every change it makes.


